{"id": "EUVD-2026-95311", "enisaUuid": "cdae00e9-f8b8-36f6-b0df-17443796bf7a", "description": "Jivejdon through 5.0 contains a cross-site request forgery vulnerability that allows remote attackers to perform state-changing actions by abusing GET endpoints lacking anti-CSRF tokens. Attackers can lure authenticated users to crafted links targeting /account/protected/delAll, /account/protected/sub/delSub, or /message/updateAction to delete private messages and subscriptions or rename threads.", "datePublished": "2026-10-08T21:51:34", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-09T13:55:02", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/banq/jivejdon/issues/28", "https://github.com/banq/jivejdon", "https://github.com/banq/jivejdon/blob/ee67a65e65228644a71c8317d7e34deea50f95ef/application/WEB-INF/struts-config-shortmessage.xml#L112-L118", "https://github.com/banq/jivejdon/blob/ee67a65e65228644a71c8317d7e34deea50f95ef/application/WEB-INF/struts-config-subscription.xml#L75-L79", "https://github.com/banq/jivejdon/blob/ee67a65e65228644a71c8317d7e34deea50f95ef/src/main/java/com/jdon/jivejdon/presentation/action/message/UpdateThreadNameAction.java#L19-L36", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jivejdon-through-5.0-csrf-via-get-based-account-and-thread-actions"], "aliases": ["GHSA-4fm4-wvj2-74v3", "CVE-2026-107831"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "5071e499-2888-3c57-aa48-01c73866d25b", "product": {"name": "jivejdon", "vendor": {"name": "banq"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22645.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "02a76f03-7fb3-3f75-9474-d96b3ddccd3c", "vendor": {"name": "banq"}}], "isExploited": false}